मण्डलम् उत्सर्जन ॥ ॰ codegen — the port of crates/sadhana/src/t1/regalloc.rs
॰                    and crates/sadhana/src/t1/x86_64.rs (emit.rs: retired
॰                    and deleted, `W-237`)

॰ ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
॰ CODE GENERATION, task D-002e, doc 03 §8 — the last slice of the D-002
॰ chain.
॰
॰ It takes what मध्यरूप built — वृत्ति, पर्व and the linear आज्ञाकोश —
॰ decides where every मूल्याङ्क lives, and turns that into text.
॰ Doc 03 §8's phase 3.4 splits the same work three ways and this file is
॰ all three: 3.4.7 the linear-scan register allocator, 3.4.8 T0 emission
॰ for riscv64, and 3.4.11 the x86-64 backend.
॰ RETIRED PAIR, 2026-09-04 (`W-236`, research/25 §1.2): the 3.4.8 claim is
॰ WITHDRAWN — `कार्यक्रमोत्सर्जनम्` and its twin `emit.rs` emit a text that is
॰ NOT T0 (`निधेहि`/`प्रत्यावर्तनम्` are in no mnemonic table, `कोष्ठ५` names no
॰ register the assembler knows, no operand carries a kāraka), so `सङ्केतन`
॰ refuses every line; the T0 emitter is `crates/sadhana/src/t1/riscv64.rs`
॰ with its twin `yantrotsarjana.t1` (यन्त्रोत्सर्जन), and `W-237` deletes the
॰ retired pair. 3.4.7 and 3.4.11 are not retired; do not extend 3.4.8.
॰ DELETED, 2026-09-04 (`W-237`): the three routines of 3.4.8 are gone from
॰ this file and `emit.rs` from the tree — see THE RETIRED T0 PAIR below.
॰
॰ ── WHAT THIS FILE REPLACES, AND WHAT IT ACTUALLY HELD ──
॰ 28 lines of tools/port_encode.py output, and IT WAS NOT THE CODEGEN
॰ THE FILENAME CLAIMS — it was regalloc.rs's two types and nothing else.
॰ Not one symbol of emit.rs or x86_64.rs appeared in it: no
॰ emit_program, no X86_64Emitter, no reg_name. Two thirds of the module
॰ were absent and the file gave no sign of it.
॰ It also INVENTED, exactly as ir.t1's predecessor did:
॰   • लओकएशअनएएनटरय — "LocationEntry". `grep -r LocationEntry` returns
॰     ZERO hits in any Rust source in this tree. regalloc.rs writes
॰     `HashMap<ValueId, Location>` and names no entry struct.
॰   • उतसरजन — a routine taking (ir.Function, AllocationMap) and
॰     returning `सम्भाव्य अङ्कः अन्तः अ८`. NOTHING in regalloc.rs,
॰     emit.rs or x86_64.rs returns bytes; both emitters return text.
॰ And it split `enum Location` into a गणना plus a संरचना without saying
॰ so, which is the right shape for T1 but was arrived at by accident.
॰ The generator now refuses to run. Every line below is hand-written
॰ from the three Rust files named at the top.
॰
॰ ── ON THE MODULE NAME ── doc 03 §2's component table names the codegen
॰ रूपकार (rūpakāra), *"codegen → T0 text"*. spec/marks.tsv has NO row
॰ for this module at all — it names विश्लेषणम् the disassembler and कोशः
॰ the object format and stops. The name kept here is उत्सर्जन, for one
॰ reason only: ir.t1 line 8 already says *"for उत्सर्जन (D-002e) to
॰ allocate registers over"*, so the sibling that feeds this module has
॰ committed to the word, and ir.t1 is not this row's file to edit.
॰ THE DISAGREEMENT IS RECORDED RATHER THAN SILENTLY DECIDED: if रूपकार
॰ wins, it is one rename here and one line in ir.t1, and doc 03 §2 is
॰ the authority that should settle it.
॰
॰ ── ON THE NAMES ── lexicon words where spec/lexicon.src.tsv has one:
॰ कोष्ठ register (attested), आवण्टकः allocator (doc11), मुक्तिः free
॰ (doc11), क्रम order (attested), संख्यानम् count (attested), रेखा line
॰ (doc05). Derived, and each said out loud because none is in the
॰ lexicon: अधिकरण — the locative kāraka, the grammarians' word for the
॰ LOCUS of an action, for Location, the locus a value lives at;
॰ निक्षेप — a deposit, a thing laid down and kept, for Spill;
॰ आयुस् — lifespan, for a live interval; सक्रिय — active.
॰ वचनम् for "the text of" follows encode.t1's सङ्केतनदोषवचनम्.
॰ यवन IS A PLACEHOLDER AND IS FLAGGED: no lexicon row names an
॰ instruction-set architecture, so x86-64's emitter has no attested
॰ name to take. यवन is the classical word for the foreign; a real name
॰ is a row in spec/lexicon.src.tsv that somebody must file, and until
॰ then this one is marked rather than passed off as attested.
॰
॰ ── ON GROUPING ── spec/grammar-t1.ebnf says operators and their
॰ precedence are NOT frozen. Every order-dependent expression below is
॰ bracketed with आरभ्य ॱ समाप्तम्, so the file means one thing under
॰ either eventual rule. मध्यरूप and संयोजन do the same.
॰
॰ ── ON THE ARENAS ── Rust holds HashMap<ValueId,(usize,usize)>,
॰ Vec<(ValueId,Instruction)> and three parallel Vec pushes. T1 has
॰ neither a map nor a growable collection. This file invents nothing:
॰ it adopts the preallocated कोश plus module-level सूचकाङ्क that
॰ व्याकर committed to and मध्यरूप followed. THE MAPS NEED NO SUBSTITUTE
॰ AT ALL — मध्यरूप numbers मूल्याङ्क from a dense 1-based counter, so a
॰ map keyed on ValueId IS an array subscripted by the value number, and
॰ that is how आयुरारम्भकोश, आयुरन्तकोश and अधिकरणकोश are written. The
॰ Vec-of-tuples become parallel arrays, because T1 has no tuple.
॰
॰ ── ON TEXT ── ADR-0017 (docs/adr/0017-a-string-literal-is-a-token.md)
॰ gave T1 a string LITERAL TOKEN: `उक्तम् … इति`, taken by the lexer
॰ before it strips the comment, interior whitespace the source's own,
॰ `॰` inside it ordinary text, a doubled `इति इति` for the word itself.
॰ The three routines below that now build text use it.
॰ NOTHING IN THIS FILE WRITES A `॰` INSIDE A LITERAL, and that is a
॰ decision rather than an oversight: this file is read by lex_t1, where
॰ a `॰` inside a string is text, AND by tests/t1_sources.rs, which
॰ reads every .t1 source with the T0 `lex`, where it still ends the
॰ line. One literal meaning two things to two readers is the exact
॰ defect ADR-0017 was written to remove.
॰
॰ CONCATENATION IS योगः, AND THIS FILE CHOOSES IT OUT LOUD — AND THEN
॰ STOPPED USING IT ON 2026-08-30. The paragraph below is kept because it
॰ is the record of a decision and B-082 still owns the question; what was
॰ found this session is that the decision HAS NO IMPLEMENTATION. `योगः`
॰ on two पाठः answers *"expected a number, found Octets"* in the one
॰ reader that executes T1, so the two routines written on it — देवनागराङ्कः
॰ and अधिकरणवचनम् — could never have been run. They are appenders now.
॰ See THE OUTPUT BUFFER below.
॰ spec/grammar-t1.ebnf freezes no operator at all — "OPERATORS AND
॰ THEIR PRECEDENCE" is its own last open section — so there is no
॰ ratified spelling to take, and two candidates existed:
॰   • अधि, doc 07 §4.2's join and the one crates/sadhana/src/t1/
॰     drishya.rs implements for a view's text_expr. REFUSED, on its own
॰     documented rule: pieces joined by अधि are "separated by exactly
॰     one space". That is right for a view and wrong for assembly,
॰     where every space in the output is the output's own.
॰   • योगः, which व्याकर already reads as an infix operator
॰     (crates/sadhana-t1/src/parse.t1:157 → वास्तुॱयोगद्विकर्मभेद) and
॰     which this file already writes on every arithmetic line. TAKEN:
॰     it coins no word, needs no lexer change, and is the same overload
॰     every language with `+` on strings makes.
॰ WHAT THAT DOES NOT SETTLE IS THE TYPE, and B-082 owns it: nothing in
॰ this tree yet distinguishes योगः on two अ६४ from योगः on two पाठः.
॰ Recorded here rather than left to be discovered there.
॰
॰ ── ON ZERO ── मध्यरूप's arenas are 1-based and ० means ABSENT, and
॰ this file keeps that. ० in आयुरारम्भकोश is `lifetimes.get(v) == None`;
॰ ० in अधिकरण ॱ भेद is `alloc.locations.get(v) == None`, which is the
॰ dead-code test emit.rs makes. ONE PLACE NEEDS AN EXCEPTION AND IT IS
॰ MARKED: register number ० is a real register (x0, %rax), so the free
॰ list cannot use ० for "empty". मुक्तकोष्ठग्रहणम् returns the register
॰ PLUS ONE and ० means the list was empty; its one caller subtracts.
॰
॰ ── WHAT IS PORTED AND WHAT IS NOT ── regalloc.rs is ported whole:
॰ all three of its symbols, and the whole body of allocate_registers,
॰ its CFG flattening, its lifetime pass and its linear scan with the
॰ spill-the-longer-interval rule. Of emit.rs's and x86_64.rs's seven
॰ routines ALL SEVEN ARE NOW REAL, as of 2026-08-30. The last three —
॰ कार्यक्रमोत्सर्जनम्, यवनवृत्त्युत्सर्जनम् and यवनाधिकरणवचनम् — landed
॰ on TWO decisions and no new code in any other file:
॰   • THE NEWLINE. ADR-0017 is NOT amended and a string literal still
॰     holds none. A newline is an OCTET THE EMITTER APPENDS, which is
॰     ADR-0018's own rule; see THE OUTPUT BUFFER below. ADR-0028's
॰     allocator was not needed and is not a prerequisite.
॰   • THE LATIN. ADR-0029 settled the register NAMES; this file settles
॰     `%`, `$`, `(`, `)` and `-` by the same principle one level down,
॰     under HOW AT&T PUNCTUATION IS WRITTEN IN THIS REPERTOIRE. Every
॰     answer there is a citation — C-15-2, the frozen numeral production,
॰     spec/lexicon.src.tsv — and not a coinage, with the ONE exception
॰     that is flagged as a debt: see (e) at the foot.
॰ (b) and (c) at the foot are rewritten to say what cleared them rather
॰ than deleted, because "it works now" and "here is the decision that
॰ made it possible" are different facts.
॰ The ratchet in tests/t1_sources.rs counts emitters with a real body,
॰ because a count of declared symbols and a count of real bodies would
॰ both read as finished while the codegen emitted nothing — and
॰ tests/t1_execution.rs now RUNS all three and asserts the octets,
॰ because a count of real bodies reads as finished while the emitter
॰ writes the wrong text. It also records the finding that stopped those
॰ tests from allocating for real: कोष्ठावण्टनम् cannot be run over a
॰ real function yet. See (f).
॰ ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

आयातः मध्यरूप ।


॰ ══════════════════ where a value lives ══════════════════
॰ Rust writes `enum Location { Register(u8), Spill(usize) }` — a tagged
॰ union with a payload. T1 has no such thing: संघः is a reserved word
॰ the grammar does not define. So the tag is an integer and the two
॰ payloads are fields of one flat struct, which is what मध्यरूप does for
॰ आज्ञा and सङ्केतन for its slot kinds. ० is not a kind: it means the
॰ value is in no location, i.e. it is not in Rust's map at all.

सार्वजनिक चरः कोष्ठाधिकरणभेद ॱॱ न६४ भवति १ ।    ॰ Location::Register(u8)
सार्वजनिक चरः निक्षेपाधिकरणभेद ॱॱ न६४ भवति २ ।  ॰ Location::Spill(usize)

सार्वजनिक संरचना अधिकरण आरभ्य   ॰ Location
    भेद ॱॱ न६४ ऽ                 ॰ ० = not allocated; else one of the two above
    कोष्ठ ॱॱ अ८ ऽ                ॰ Register's u8 — ० is a REAL register
    निक्षेप ॱॱ अ३२               ॰ Spill's slot number
समाप्तम् ।


॰ ══════════════════ the result of allocation ══════════════════
॰ Rust's AllocationMap has `locations: HashMap<ValueId, Location>` and
॰ `num_spills: usize`. The map is keyed on a dense 1-based counter, so
॰ it is stored as अधिकरणकोश below, SUBSCRIPTED BY THE VALUE NUMBER
॰ ITSELF rather than appended — this is the one arena in the crate that
॰ is not filled by an advancing सूचकाङ्क, and it is not, because the key
॰ is the index. The struct therefore carries how far that array is
॰ meaningful, not the array.

सार्वजनिक संरचना आवण्टनम् आरभ्य   ॰ AllocationMap
    अधिकरणसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ ऽ        ॰ locations: the highest value number mapped
    निक्षेपसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४          ॰ num_spills
समाप्तम् ।


॰ ══════════════════ the allocator's working state ══════════════════
॰ Every one of these is a `let mut` inside allocate_registers. Rust gets
॰ them emptied for free on each call; here they are the module's, as
॰ व्याकर and मध्यरूप hold theirs, and आवण्टनारम्भः below empties them.

॰ linear_seq: Vec<(ValueId, Instruction)>, as two parallel arrays.
सार्वजनिक चरः रेखाज्ञाकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।    ॰ index into मध्यरूपॱआज्ञाकोश; ० = the synthetic return entry
सार्वजनिक चरः रेखामूल्यकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।   ॰ the ValueId defined at this position
सार्वजनिक चरः रेखासंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।

॰ lifetimes: HashMap<ValueId, (usize, usize)>, as two arrays keyed on
॰ the value number. आयुरारम्भकोश ० is `lifetimes.get(v) == None`, which
॰ is what makes `or_insert` and `get_mut` expressible.
सार्वजनिक चरः आयुरारम्भकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः आयुरन्तकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।

॰ intervals: Vec<(ValueId, (usize, usize))> sorted by start. Only the
॰ value number is stored — the pair is fetched from the two arrays above.
सार्वजनिक चरः क्रमकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः क्रमसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।

॰ locations: HashMap<ValueId, Location>. Subscripted by the value number.
सार्वजनिक चरः अधिकरणकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अधिकरण भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः निक्षेपसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।            ॰ next_spill

॰ free_registers: Vec<u8>, used as a stack — pushed on expiry, popped on
॰ allocation. मुक्तकोष्ठसंख्यान is its length and its top.
सार्वजनिक चरः मुक्तकोष्ठकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः मुक्तकोष्ठसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।

॰ active: Vec<(ValueId, end, reg)>, as three parallel arrays. Kept
॰ sorted by end ascending, so the LAST entry is the longest-lived one —
॰ which is the entry Rust's `active.last()` reads to choose a spill.
सार्वजनिक चरः सक्रियमूल्यकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः सक्रियावसानकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः सक्रियकोष्ठकोश ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः न६४ भवति ० ।
सार्वजनिक चरः सक्रियसंख्यान ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।

॰ the highest value number this pass has seen. Rust needs no such thing:
॰ a HashMap iterates its own keys. An array cannot, so the walk needs a
॰ bound, and this is it.
सार्वजनिक चरः मूल्यसीमा ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।

॰ ══════════ `V-005` — THE FILE THIS PASS FILLS ══════════
॰ `regalloc.rs`'s `allocate_registers_for(func, n, class, classify)` is run
॰ ONCE PER REGISTER FILE, and a value enters the interval set only when the
॰ file its definition puts it in is the one being filled. ० is the integer
॰ file and the default, so every caller that sets nothing allocates exactly
॰ what it allocated before this row; the emitter sets १ for the float pass and
॰ puts ० back. Read in ONE place, `आयुर्निर्णयः`'s definition step.
सार्वजनिक चरः आवण्टनवर्गः ॱॱ न६४ भवति ० ।


॰ ══════════════════ constructing a Location ══════════════════
॰ `Location::Register(r)` and `Location::Spill(s)`, which T1 has to
॰ spell out because it has no variant constructor to call. One routine,
॰ because अधिकरण is one struct with a tag — the same move मध्यरूप makes
॰ for अवसानरचना.

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः अधिकरणरचना आदाय भेद ॱॱ न६४ ऽ कोष्ठ ॱॱ अ८ ऽ निक्षेप ॱॱ अ३२ ददाति अधिकरण आदि
    चरः नव ॱॱ अधिकरण भवति ० ।
    नव ॱ भेद भवति भेद ।
    नव ॱ कोष्ठ भवति कोष्ठ ।
    नव ॱ निक्षेप भवति निक्षेप ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् नव ।
इति


॰ ══════════════════ emptying the state ══════════════════
॰ The `let mut` declarations at the head of allocate_registers. The two
॰ lifetime arrays and अधिकरणकोश must be cleared ENTRY BY ENTRY up to the
॰ previous मूल्यसीमा, because ० in them is load-bearing — a stale start
॰ from a previous function would make `or_insert` skip a live value.

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः आवण्टनारम्भः ददाति न६४ आदि
    ॰ CLEARED TO THE HIGHEST VALUE मध्यरूप HAS HANDED OUT, `W-236` — not to the
    ॰ previous pass's मूल्यसीमा alone. Note (f) at the foot recorded why this
    ॰ routine could not run over a real function: मूल्यसीमा is ० on the first
    ॰ call, so nothing was written before आयुर्निर्णयः read value १ and the
    ॰ arena refused. This is the second of the two repairs (f) named — "an
    ॰ आवण्टनारम्भः that is told how many values मध्यरूप handed out" — and the
    ॰ teller is मध्यरूपॱअग्रिममूल्याङ्क, the counter नवमूल्यम् advances: every
    ॰ value number a function can name has a written ० before it is read.
    ॰ Rust's HashMap needs none of this; an absent key IS None there.
    चरः सीमा ॱॱ न६४ भवति मूल्यसीमा ।
    यदि मध्यरूपॱअग्रिममूल्याङ्क अधिकम् सीमा आदि
        सीमा भवति मध्यरूपॱअग्रिममूल्याङ्क ।
    इति
    चरः सूचकाङ्क ॱॱ न६४ भवति १ ।
    यावत् सूचकाङ्क न्यूनम् आरभ्य सीमा योगः १ समाप्तम् आदि
        आयुरारम्भकोश अङ्कः सूचकाङ्क अन्तः भवति ० ।
        आयुरन्तकोश अङ्कः सूचकाङ्क अन्तः भवति ० ।
        अधिकरणकोश अङ्कः सूचकाङ्क अन्तः भवति अधिकरणरचना आरभ्य ० ऽ ० ऽ ० समाप्तम् ।
        सूचकाङ्क भवति आरभ्य सूचकाङ्क योगः १ समाप्तम् ।
    इति
    रेखासंख्यान भवति ० ।
    क्रमसंख्यान भवति ० ।
    निक्षेपसंख्यान भवति ० ।
    मुक्तकोष्ठसंख्यान भवति ० ।
    सक्रियसंख्यान भवति ० ।
    मूल्यसीमा भवति ० ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।
इति


॰ ══════════════════ linear_seq.push ══════════════════
॰ Rust pushes `(*def_val, inst.clone())`. There is no clone here and
॰ none is wanted: मध्यरूपॱआज्ञाकोश already holds the instruction and it
॰ is not moved, so the position stores its INDEX. आज्ञासूचकाङ्क ० is the
॰ synthetic entry the Return arm pushes, which has no instruction.

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः रेखायोजनम् आदाय आज्ञासूचकाङ्क ॱॱ न६४ ऽ मूल्यम् ॱॱ न६४ ददाति न६४ आदि
    रेखासंख्यान भवति आरभ्य रेखासंख्यान योगः १ समाप्तम् ।
    रेखाज्ञाकोश अङ्कः रेखासंख्यान अन्तः भवति आज्ञासूचकाङ्क ।
    रेखामूल्यकोश अङ्कः रेखासंख्यान अन्तः भवति मूल्यम् ।
    यदि मूल्यम् अधिकम् मूल्यसीमा आदि
        मूल्यसीमा भवति मूल्यम् ।
    इति
    प्रत्यागमनम् रेखासंख्यान ।
इति


॰ ══════════════════ step 1 — flatten the CFG ══════════════════
॰ Rust sorts `func.blocks.keys()` by BlockId and walks them, because a
॰ HashMap has no order. HERE THE SORT IS ALREADY DONE AND IS NOT
॰ REWRITTEN: मध्यरूप appends a function's blocks to पर्वकोश in id order
॰ and records the run as पर्वारम्भ plus पर्वसंख्यान, so walking the run
॰ IS walking the sorted keys. That invariant is मध्यरूप's, stated in its
॰ own header, and a second sort here would only be able to disagree
॰ with it.
॰
॰ ON THE DUMMY THE RUST COMMENT PROMISES — regalloc.rs pushes
॰ `(v, Instruction::ConstInt(0))` for a `Return(Some(v))` and comments
॰ it "// Dummy use". IT IS NOT A USE. ConstInt falls into the lifetime
॰ pass's `_ => {}` arm, so no interval end is extended by it; all it
॰ does is make the sequence one position longer, shifting every later
॰ block. That is a defect in the Rust original, not in this port, and it
॰ is ported AS WRITTEN — the returned value's interval ends where its
॰ last real use was, exactly as in Rust. Fixing it here would put the
॰ two files out of step and make this file the origin of a behaviour
॰ rather than the port of one; it belongs on a row against regalloc.rs.

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः रेखीकरणम् आदाय वृत्तिसूचकाङ्क ॱॱ न६४ ददाति न६४ आदि
    यदि वृत्तिसूचकाङ्क समम् ० आदि
        प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।
    इति

    चरः कार्यम् ॱॱ मध्यरूपॱवृत्ति भवति मध्यरूपॱवृत्तिकोश अङ्कः वृत्तिसूचकाङ्क अन्तः ।
    चरः पर्वाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति कार्यम् ॱ पर्वारम्भ ।
    चरः शेषपर्व ॱॱ न६४ भवति कार्यम् ॱ पर्वसंख्यान ।

    यावत् शेषपर्व अधिकम् ० आदि
        चरः पर्वम् ॱॱ मध्यरूपॱपर्व भवति मध्यरूपॱपर्वकोश अङ्कः पर्वाङ्कः अन्तः ।
        चरः आज्ञाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति पर्वम् ॱ आज्ञारम्भ ।
        चरः शेषाज्ञा ॱॱ न६४ भवति पर्वम् ॱ आज्ञासंख्यान ।

        ॰ for (def_val, inst) in &block.insts { linear_seq.push(..) }
        यावत् शेषाज्ञा अधिकम् ० आदि
            चरः आदेशः ॱॱ मध्यरूपॱआज्ञा भवति मध्यरूपॱआज्ञाकोश अङ्कः आज्ञाङ्कः अन्तः ।
            चरः फलाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ फलम् ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
            चरः अवगणना ॱॱ न६४ भवति रेखायोजनम् आरभ्य आज्ञाङ्कः ऽ फलाङ्कः समाप्तम् ।
            आज्ञाङ्कः भवति आरभ्य आज्ञाङ्कः योगः १ समाप्तम् ।
            शेषाज्ञा भवति आरभ्य शेषाज्ञा वियोगः १ समाप्तम् ।
        इति

        ॰ if let Some(Terminator::Return(Some(v))) = block.terminator
        यदि पर्वम् ॱ अवसानम् ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱप्रत्यागमनावसानभेद आदि
            चरः प्रत्यागतम् ॱॱ न६४ भवति पर्वम् ॱ अवसानम् ॱ मूल्यम् ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
            ॰ ० is Return(None) — मध्यरूप's spelling of the inner Option.
            यदि प्रत्यागतम् अधिकम् ० आदि
                चरः अवगणनद्वि ॱॱ न६४ भवति रेखायोजनम् आरभ्य ० ऽ प्रत्यागतम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति
        इति

        पर्वाङ्कः भवति आरभ्य पर्वाङ्कः योगः १ समाप्तम् ।
        शेषपर्व भवति आरभ्य शेषपर्व वियोगः १ समाप्तम् ।
    इति

    प्रत्यागमनम् रेखासंख्यान ।
इति


॰ ══════════════════ `V-005` — `classify(def_val, inst)` ══════════════════
॰ The file the instruction at आज्ञाकोश index `आज्ञाङ्कः` leaves its value in:
॰ १ for a float op whose result is a float (`मध्यरूपॱप्लवफलम्`), for a
॰ `प६४` local's read (kind १५, `उपभेद` १) and a `प६४` slot's read from memory
॰ (kind २२, `उपभेद` १, `V-008`); ० for every other instruction — and
॰ for index ०, the synthetic Return entry, which Rust pushes as `ConstInt(0)`
॰ and classifies as such. THE CLASSIFIER LIVES HERE AND NOT IN THE EMITTER
॰ because this pass is its one caller and the dependency already points this
॰ way; `यन्त्रोत्सर्जन`'s `यन्त्रप्लववर्गः`, the twin of `riscv64.rs`'s
॰ `value_class`, answers through it, so there is one rule and not two.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः आज्ञावर्गः आदाय आज्ञाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ ददाति न६४ आदि
    यदि आज्ञाङ्कः समम् ० आदि
        प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।
    इति
    चरः आदेशः ॱॱ मध्यरूपॱआज्ञा भवति मध्यरूपॱआज्ञाकोश अङ्कः आज्ञाङ्कः अन्तः ।
    ॰ the float load, a `प६४` parameter and a call answering `प६४`: `उपभेद` १
    ॰ on kinds १५, ५ and २ — and `V-008`'s float read from memory, on २२.
    चरः चिह्नितभेदः ॱॱ बूल भवति असत्यम् ।
    यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱआहाराज्ञाभेद आदि चिह्नितभेदः भवति सत्यम् । इति
    यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱस्थानाहाराज्ञाभेद आदि चिह्नितभेदः भवति सत्यम् । इति
    यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱप्राचलाज्ञाभेद आदि चिह्नितभेदः भवति सत्यम् । इति
    यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱआह्वानाज्ञाभेद आदि चिह्नितभेदः भवति सत्यम् । इति
    यदि चिह्नितभेदः समम् सत्यम् आदि
        यदि आदेशः ॱ उपभेद समम् १ आदि
            प्रत्यागमनम् १ ।
        इति
    इति
    यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱप्लवाज्ञाभेद आदि
        यदि मध्यरूपॱप्लवफलम् आदेशः ॱ उपभेद समम् सत्यम् आदि
            प्रत्यागमनम् १ ।
        इति
    इति
    प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।
इति


॰ ══════════════════ `if let Some(lt) = lifetimes.get_mut(x)` ══════════════════
॰ The three-line idiom regalloc.rs writes five times over. A value that
॰ has no interval yet — get_mut returning None — is left alone, which is
॰ what the Rust `if let` does and is not the same as clamping it to ०.

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः आयुर्विस्तारः आदाय मूल्यम् ॱॱ न६४ ऽ पदम् ॱॱ न६४ ददाति न६४ आदि
    यदि मूल्यम् समम् ० आदि
        प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।
    इति
    यदि आयुरारम्भकोश अङ्कः मूल्यम् अन्तः समम् ० आदि
        प्रत्यागमनम् ० ।     ॰ get_mut returned None
    इति
    आयुरन्तकोश अङ्कः मूल्यम् अन्तः भवति पदम् ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् पदम् ।
इति


॰ ══════════════════ step 2 — compute lifetimes ══════════════════
॰ `lifetimes.entry(*def_val).or_insert((i, i))` for the definition, then
॰ one arm per instruction kind for the uses. Add and Sub share a body in
॰ Rust through an or-pattern; T1 has no or-pattern, so they are two
॰ यदि with the same three lines.
॰
॰ ON THE MISSING Call ARM — see (a) at the foot of the file.

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः आयुर्निर्णयः ददाति न६४ आदि
    चरः पदम् ॱॱ न६४ भवति १ ।

    यावत् पदम् न्यूनम् आरभ्य रेखासंख्यान योगः १ समाप्तम् आदि
        ॰ the definition
        चरः मूल्यम् ॱॱ न६४ भवति रेखामूल्यकोश अङ्कः पदम् अन्तः ।
        ॰ `V-005` — ONLY IF THIS VALUE BELONGS TO THE FILE BEING FILLED, and it is
        ॰ a GUARD on the definition and not a skip of the position: an
        ॰ out-of-file instruction still USES in-file operands (a float compare
        ॰ reads floats and defines an integer), and the use arms below must still
        ॰ extend them — `regalloc.rs`'s margin on the same line.
        चरः पदवर्गः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आज्ञावर्गः रेखाज्ञाकोश अङ्कः पदम् अन्तः ।
        ॰ `V-005` — THE RETURN'S DUMMY ENTRY (आज्ञाङ्क ०) TAKES ITS VALUE'S OWN
        ॰ FILE, `मध्यरूप`'s record of it (`मूल्यप्लवकोश`), not the integer file
        ॰ a missing instruction would suggest: otherwise a returned float enters
        ॰ the integer map here as well, and the integer map is asked first.
        ॰ `regalloc.rs` classifies the dummy by the value's defining
        ॰ instruction, which is the same answer.
        यदि रेखाज्ञाकोश अङ्कः पदम् अन्तः समम् ० आदि
            चरः शुष्कमूल्यम् ॱॱ न६४ भवति रेखामूल्यकोश अङ्कः पदम् अन्तः ।
            यदि शुष्कमूल्यम् न्यूनम् मध्यरूपॱमूल्यप्लवकोश ॱ दैर्घ्य आदि
                पदवर्गः भवति मध्यरूपॱमूल्यप्लवकोश अङ्कः शुष्कमूल्यम् अन्तः ।
            इति
        इति
        यदि पदवर्गः असमम् आवण्टनवर्गः आदि
            मूल्यम् भवति ० ।
        इति
        यदि मूल्यम् अधिकम् ० आदि
            यदि आयुरारम्भकोश अङ्कः मूल्यम् अन्तः समम् ० आदि
                आयुरारम्भकोश अङ्कः मूल्यम् अन्तः भवति पदम् ।
                आयुरन्तकोश अङ्कः मूल्यम् अन्तः भवति पदम् ।
            इति
        इति

        ॰ the uses
        चरः आज्ञाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति रेखाज्ञाकोश अङ्कः पदम् अन्तः ।
        यदि आज्ञाङ्कः अधिकम् ० आदि
            चरः आदेशः ॱॱ मध्यरूपॱआज्ञा भवति मध्यरूपॱआज्ञाकोश अङ्कः आज्ञाङ्कः अन्तः ।

            ॰ Instruction::Add(lhs, rhs)
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱयोगाज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः वामाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः दक्षिणाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ दक्षिण ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणना ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य वामाङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
                चरः अवगणनद्वि ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य दक्षिणाङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति

            ॰ Instruction::Sub(lhs, rhs) — the other half of Rust's or-pattern
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱवियोगाज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः वामाङ्कद्वि ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः दक्षिणाङ्कद्वि ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ दक्षिण ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणनत्रि ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य वामाङ्कद्वि ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
                चरः अवगणनचतुः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य दक्षिणाङ्कद्वि ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति

            ॰ `W-245` — the nine binary kinds that row added share Add's shape
            ॰ (Rust's or-pattern grew by nine arms: Mul Div Rem Shl Shr And Or
            ॰ Xor Cmp), and a Store reads the value in वाम. One यदि over a
            ॰ range test rather than nine copies of the three lines, because
            ॰ the kinds are numbered ६..१४ in a run and a Store is १६.
            चरः द्विपदम् ॱॱ बूल भवति असत्यम् ।
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद बृहत्समम् मध्यरूपॱगुणनाज्ञाभेद आदि
                यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद न्यूनम् आरभ्य मध्यरूपॱतुलनाज्ञाभेद योगः १ समाप्तम् आदि
                    द्विपदम् भवति सत्यम् ।
                इति
            इति
            यदि द्विपदम् समम् सत्यम् आदि
                चरः वामाङ्कनव ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः दक्षिणाङ्कनव ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ दक्षिण ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणनषट् ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य वामाङ्कनव ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
                चरः अवगणनसप्त ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य दक्षिणाङ्कनव ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱनिधानाज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः निहिताङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणनाष्ट ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य निहिताङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति
            ॰ ॥ THE INDEX READ'S TWO OPERANDS ARE USES, AND THIS IS THE ARM A
            ॰ NEW KIND IS SILENTLY MISSING FROM ॥
            ॰
            ॰ THIS ROUTINE IS THE TWIN OF `Instruction::operands()` and it is
            ॰ NOT DERIVED FROM ANYTHING — it is a hand-written list of arms, one
            ॰ per kind that reads a value, where the Rust side is a `match` the
            ॰ compiler makes exhaustive. So Rust CANNOT forget a kind here and
            ॰ this file always can, and nothing goes red at the omission: the
            ॰ liveness is merely SHORTER, the allocator reuses a register a
            ॰ moment too early, and the two emitters print different registers.
            ॰
            ॰ MEASURED, not reasoned. Without this arm, a five-line program
            ॰ holding one `क अङ्कः २ अन्तः` diverged in its PROLOGUE — the T1
            ॰ twin subtracted ऋण३२ where `riscv64.rs` subtracted ऋण४८ — because
            ॰ the two disagreed about how many callee-saved registers the
            ॰ routine uses, which follows from the allocation, which follows
            ॰ from these live ranges. Fourteen of nineteen corpus sources
            ॰ diverged from that one omission.
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱसूच्याज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः सूच्याधाराङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः सूच्यन्तराङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ दक्षिण ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणनसूच्येकः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य सूच्याधाराङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
                चरः अवगणनसूच्यद्वि ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य सूच्यन्तराङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति


            ॰ ॥ AND `क्षेत्राज्ञाभेद` IS MISSING FROM THIS ROUTINE ON MAIN ॥
            ॰ `LoadField`'s base is a use — `ir.rs`'s `operands()` says so, with
            ॰ the margin "the base is a real use: DCE must not drop what computed
            ॰ the reference this reads through" — and no arm here extends it.
            ॰ Its landing was green because a live range that is too short only
            ॰ bites when it CHANGES an allocation, and on that corpus it did not.
            ॰
            ॰ FIXED HERE RATHER THAN ONLY REPORTED, and the choice is worth its
            ॰ line: it is another lane's measured commit and this arm may move
            ॰ their figures, which is a real cost. Leaving a known wrong live
            ॰ range in place to protect a number is the worse trade — the number
            ॰ would then be measuring the defect. Reported to the trunk in the
            ॰ same breath so the movement is expected rather than discovered.
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱक्षेत्राज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः क्षेत्राधाराङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणनक्षेत्रायुः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य क्षेत्राधाराङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति

            ॰ ॥ `W-283` — THE RULED STORAGE MODEL'S TWO READING KINDS ॥
            ॰ THE MARGIN ABOVE PREDICTED THIS EXACTLY AND I WALKED INTO IT
            ॰ ANYWAY. I added `AddrOfGlobal`, `LoadAt` and `StoreAt`, updated
            ॰ `ir.rs`'s `operands()` — which the compiler forces — and did not
            ॰ update this hand-written twin. Nothing went red at the omission,
            ॰ exactly as `:454` says: the liveness was merely SHORTER.
            ॰
            ॰ MEASURED, and the signature is the one `:458` records for the
            ॰ previous instance: FIFTEEN corpus sources diverged, and
            ॰ `nidana.t1` diverged in its PROLOGUE — the T1 twin subtracted
            ॰ ऋण१६ where `riscv64.rs` subtracted ऋण३२ — because the two
            ॰ disagreed about callee-saved registers, which follows from the
            ॰ allocation, which follows from these live ranges. Fourteen then,
            ॰ fifteen now, same cause.
            ॰
            ॰ `वैश्विकस्थानाज्ञाभेद` २१ GETS NO ARM AND THAT IS NOT AN OVERSIGHT:
            ॰ it forms an address from a LABEL and takes no value operand, so it
            ॰ uses nothing. `ir.rs` puts it in the `Vec::new()` group for the
            ॰ same reason, beside `LoadGlobal`, which is likewise absent here
            ॰ and likewise correct.
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱस्थानाहाराज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः स्थानाहाराङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
                चरः अवगणनस्थानाहारायुः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आयुर्विस्तारः आरभ्य स्थानाहाराङ्कः ऽ पदम् समाप्तम् ।
            इति

            ॰ BOTH operands are uses, and the second is the one an arm written
            ॰ from the load's shape would drop: `वाम` is the ADDRESS and
            ॰ `दक्षिण` is the value STORED. A store that extended only its
            ॰ address would let the allocator reuse the value's register before
            ॰ the store reads it — a wrong word written, with nothing red.
            यदि आदेशः ॱ भेद समम् मध्यरूपॱस्थाननिधानाज्ञाभेद आदि
                चरः निधानस्थानाङ्कः ॱॱ न६४ भवति आदेशः ॱ वाम ॱ क्रमाङ्क ।
