            ॰ omission, exactly as `:454` says.
            ॰
            ॰ MEASURED, AND THE SIGNATURE IS THE SAME ONE THREE TIMES RUNNING:
            ॰ the whole-corpus twin census diverged on SEVENTEEN sources, 26 of
            ॰ the divergences in a PROLOGUE — `nidana.t1`, `parse.t1` and
            ॰ `vishlesana.t1` each by exactly 16 octets, the T1 twin subtracting
            ॰ less because it thought fewer registers were live. Fourteen, then
            ॰ fifteen, now seventeen. **THE COUNT RISES EACH TIME BECAUSE THE
            ॰ CORPUS DOES; the cause has not changed once.**
